nal and hepatic pathways\",\n            \"explanation\": \"氧烯洛尔 (oxprenolol), a beta-blocker, demonstrates complex pharmacokinetic interactions, including stereoselective metabolism influenced by co-administered drugs like 西咪替丁 (cimetidine) [Data: Relationships (50730)]. Evidence from human liver microsomal studies suggests that drug interactions affecting enantiomer-specific clearance—particularly in renal tubular secretion—can alter systemic exposure differentially between R- and S-enantiomers. Although direct links to other community entities are limited, this highlights the broader theme of chirality-dependent drug interactions relevant to safe polypharmacy, especially in cardiovascular or CNS-active medications.\"\n        }\n    ],\n    \"rating\": 6.5,\n    \"rating_explanation\": \"The community presents moderate-to-high clinical impact due to 丙磺舒’s widespread influence on drug levels, diagnostic accuracy, and contraindications in vulnerable populations, with potential for serious adverse events if interactions are unmanaged.\"\n}", "refusal": null, "role": "assistant", "annotations": null, "audio": null, "function_call": null, "tool_calls": null, "provider_specific_fields": {"refusal": null}}, "provider_specific_fields": {}}], "created": 1782121769, "model": "qwen3-max", "object": "chat.completion", "moderation": null, "service_tier": null, "system_fingerprint": null, "usage": {"completion_tokens": 1500, "prompt_tokens": 6297, "total_tokens": 7797, "completion_tokens_details": null, "prompt_tokens_details": {"audio_tokens": null, "cached_tokens": 1280}}, "formatted_response": null, "content": "{\n    \"title\": \"丙磺舒-Centric Pharmacological Interaction Network\",\n    \"summary\": \"This community centers on the drug 丙磺舒 (Probenecid), which exhibits extensive pharmacological relationships with multiple drugs, drug classes, clinical indicators, and disease conditions. 丙磺舒 influences the blood concentrations of several antibiotics and diagnostic agents by in